# The Last Ride's "{2}{B}, Pay 2 life: Draw a card." Black Lotus and a Mox Jet make four mana; the Ride's {B} leaves three,
# which pays the ability once: Bot1 goes to 18 life and draws the Swamp on top (hand 4 -> 5). A second activation is refused for
# lack of mana (the Mox and Lotus are spent).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
The Last Ride
Swamp x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
