Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.The Last Ride.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.The Last Ride.Activate(Ability: Draw)
Bot1.Pass
